 ],
 "text": "What if you got twice as rich every day? Day 1. $1. Day 10. $500. You buy everyone lunch. Day 20. Half a million. Your phone won't stop ringing. Day 30. 500 million. You buy the building you rent in. Day 40. 500 billion. Richer than anyone alive. The bank calls you, sir. Day 48. 140 trillion. More than the whole world earns in a year. Day 50. 500 trillion. You own more than everything on earth. Day 51. There's nothing left to buy. Your friend still asks you to split the bill."
